id=wsa_egl_surfaceless
name=WSA GL fixes
version=v3
versionCode=3
author=Sardelka9515
description=Fixes for WSA's OpenGL ES drivers: adds surfaceless EGL contexts (startup crashes, e.g. Bully) and emulates vertex array objects for the apps in debug.gles.vaoemu (torn geometry, e.g. Bully), and sets Bully's frame-rate cap from debug.bully.fps.
